{"id":"106100-22-42de","year":106,"exam":"106年第二次專門職業及技術人員高等考試醫師考試分階段考試（第一階段考試）、牙醫師藥師考試分階段考試、藥師、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、物理治療師、職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師考試、106年專門職業及技術人員高等考試助產師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"獸醫藥理學","code":"2314","type":"測驗題","fixed":false,"classes":["獸醫師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=106100&c=314&s=22&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"當藥物之hepatic extraction ratio接近於1時，其主要意義為何？","opts":["藥物吸收後快速的分布至組織","藥物經口投予後顯著的首渡效應","藥物緊密結合於血漿蛋白","藥物之清除不受肝臟血流量影響"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"多數酸性藥物主要和下列何種血漿蛋白結合？","opts":["白蛋白（albumin）","球蛋白（globulin）","α -酸性醣蛋白（α -acid glycoprotein）1＿＿＿1","脂蛋白（lipoprotein）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"由公式0.693•藥物分布容積／廓清率可以得到何種參數？","opts":["藥物之維持劑量","藥物之清除速率","藥物之半衰期","藥物之血漿穩定濃度"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"對於緩慢釋出之長效劑型而言，影響藥物效應之決定步驟主要為：","opts":["藥物之分布速率","藥物之吸收速率","藥物之排除速率","藥物之代謝速率"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"當血漿之pH值為7.4而pKa值為4.4之酸性藥物，則血漿中離子化與非離子化藥物濃度之比為：","opts":["1：1","1：1000","1000：1","0.01：1"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"下列何者屬於藥效學之範圍？","opts":["藥物之EC50","藥物之Cmax","藥物之半衰期","藥物之廓清率"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"貓因為缺乏glucuronyl transferase，因此藥物aspirin之排除主要遵循下列何種機制？","opts":["first-pass effect","first-order kinetics","zero-order kinetics","biphasic kinetics"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"關於doxapram的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["於獸醫學上可做為呼吸興奮劑","可活化主動脈和頸動脈的化學受體","使用於麻醉劑過量之動物，會降低麻醉的深度，但作用可能很短暫","對嚴重呼吸抑制之新生動物的甦醒有效"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"關於benzodiazepines的描述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["可以使用為抗痙攣劑","主要增加鈉離子通道開啟的活性而引起神經高度極化","貓口服diazepam幾日後可能出現急性肝壞死","犬靜脈注射可以控制癲癇重積狀態及密集發作"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"關於propofol的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["臨床上以靜脈注射投予","經由活化伽瑪-胺基丁酸A型受體引起麻醉","藥效發揮快速且誘導平順，但是重覆投藥會發生蓄積","和血漿蛋白高度結合"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"若用於惠比特犬（whippets）的誘導麻醉，下列何者恢復時間較短？","opts":["phenobarbital","pentobarbital","methohexital","etorphine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"臨床上acepromazine不適合使用於下列何種目的？","opts":["止吐作用","預防心律不整","鎮痛作用","安神作用"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"下列何者最方便、最適合用於小型囓齒類實驗動物之安樂死？","opts":["curare","T-61","CO2","hydrogen cyanide"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"具有抗心律不整的局部麻醉藥是：","opts":["lidocaine","etidocaine","mepivacaine","ropivacaine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"Ketamine之作用係透過阻斷以下何種受體？","opts":["nicotine受體","dopamine受體","GABA受體","NMDA受體"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"下列有關methoxyflurane與isoflurane差異的敘述中，何者正確？","opts":["methoxyflurane具有較快的誘導","isoflurane的血／氣分配係數較小","methoxyflurane排出體外的速度較快","isoflurane的代謝百分率較高"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"臨床上使用spironolactone利尿後，所產生之不良反應主要為何？","opts":["代謝性酸中毒","高血糖症","高血鈣症","高血鉀症"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"下列何者最適合優先使用於控制犬之高血壓？","opts":["digitalis","enalapril","dobutamine","yohimbine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"Acetazolamide作用在腎元的那一個部位？","opts":["近端腎小管","亨利氏環上行支","遠端腎小管前端","遠端腎小管後端"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":20,"q":"Digitalis的強心作用機制是：","opts":["抑制phosphodiesterase","結合於β -adrenergic receptors1","促進Na+-Ca++ATPase","抑制Na+, K+-ATPase"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":21,"q":"下列血管擴張劑中，何者對小動脈平滑肌有顯著擴張作用，但對靜脈平滑肌的作用卻很弱？","opts":["hydralazine","nitroglycerine","sodium nitroprusside","isosorbide dinitrate"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":22,"q":"下列何者的作用機制是抑制phosphodiesterase導致細胞內cAMP增加，造成細胞內鈣離子亦增加而使心肌收縮？","opts":["digoxin","dobutamine","amrinone","nitroprusside"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":23,"q":"下列抗心律不整藥，何者可在竇房結和房室結拮抗迷走神經作用？","opts":["atropine","atenolol","amiodarone","diltiazem"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":24,"q":"下列何者能抑制血小板凝集？","opts":["aminocaproic acid","tranexamic acid","clopidogrel","protamine sulfate"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":25,"q":"下列何者對巨母紅血球性貧血症無效？","opts":["cyanocobalamin","intrinsic factor of gastric mucosal cells","folic acid","ferrous sulfate"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":26,"q":"下列何者為serotonin受體抑制劑？","opts":["cyproheptadine","hydroxyzine","dobutamine","phenylephrine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":27,"q":"下列何種成分，可與維生素E共同作用降低脂肪的過氧化作用？","opts":["鈣","鎂","磷","硒"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":28,"q":"下列有關bismuth subsalicylate的作用，何者錯誤？","opts":["具吸附作用","抗下痢作用","黏膜保護作用","促進前列腺素合成"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":29,"q":"Zileuton降低leukotrienes的作用機制是：","opts":["抑制cyclooxygenase","抑制phospholipase A2","抑制diacylglycerol lipase","抑制lipoxygenase"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":30,"q":"下列何者是misoprostol用於預防非固醇類消炎藥所引起胃潰瘍的主要原理？","opts":["抑制胃酸分泌的作用優於質子幫浦抑制劑","不具全身性作用","不經肝臟代謝","具有類似prostaglandin E 的作用1"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":31,"q":"在動物氣喘時，下列何者可以有效地作為緊急支氣管擴張用？","opts":["cromolyn","ipratropium","terbutaline","budesonide"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":32,"q":"動物缺乏下列何種營養素會導致出血？","opts":["phylloquinone","retinol","thiamine","tocopherol"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"使用非選擇性腎上腺素性藥物擴張支氣管，最可能出現的副作用為：","opts":["腹痛下痢","心跳過快","瞳孔縮小","血壓降低"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"下列何者對貓具有催吐作用？","opts":["phenothiazines","dolasetron","xylazine","ondansetron"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"下列何者不是使用制酸劑（antacids）常見的副作用？","opts":["代償性胃酸分泌","便秘／緩瀉","減少其他同時服用藥品的吸收","中樞抑制"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列何者不是維生素A的生理功能？","opts":["維持正常視力","維持上皮細胞的正常結構","維持正常生殖功能","維持肌肉張力"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"下列何者常作為化痰劑以加強酸性黏多醣體的水解？","opts":["dimenhydrinate","hydroxyzine","phenylephrine","bromhexine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"Methylcellulose是屬於下列何種瀉劑？","opts":["容積性瀉劑（bulk laxatives）","潤滑性瀉劑（emollient laxatives）","刺激性瀉劑（irritant laxatives）","高滲透壓性瀉劑（hyperosmotic laxatives）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"關於ketoprofen之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["為選擇性cyclooxygenase抑制劑","可阻斷leukotriene B 之生合成4","促進蛋白多醣（proteoglycan）之生合成","對發炎關節具有消炎作用"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"關於ergovaline之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["由Acremonium coenophialum的黴菌所產生","是牛毛草中毒（Fescue grass toxicity）的主要毒物","是動脈之收縮劑","對胃腸道、子宮、支氣管平滑肌皆具有抑制作用"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"血管升壓素II（angiotensin II）有二個受體亞型，下列何者是AT 受體的拮抗劑？1","opts":["losartan","aliskiren","captopril","enalapril"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"下列有關H -抗組織胺的敘述，何者正確？2","opts":["常用於治療過敏反應","無法口服投予","Cimetidine具抑制cytochrome P-450的作用","Ranitidine和cromolyn的作用機制相同"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"糖質腎上腺皮質素酮（glucocorticoids）於藥理劑量時的消炎作用之機制為何？","opts":["抑制磷脂酶A （phospholipase A ）2＿＿＿2","抑制酪胺酸激酶（tyrosine kinase）","抑制血管加壓素轉化酶（angiotensin converting enzyme）","抑制protein kinase G"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"Propylthiouracil可用於下列何種疾病？","opts":["腫瘤","心衰竭","甲狀腺亢進","球蟲感染"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"下列何者屬於第一代的抗組織胺？","opts":["dopamine","dobutamine","hydroxytryptamine","chlorpheniramine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"快速靜脈注射下列何者，最有可能導致肥大細胞釋放組織胺？","opts":["meclizine","morphine","metronidazole","mannitol"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"下列有關chlorhexidine的敘述中，何者正確？","opts":["分類上屬於天然植物鹼","可為硬水所不活化","常用於大規模的環境消毒","殺菌能力較酒精快，但殘留時間短"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":48,"q":"下列有關乙醇（ethyl alcohol）及異丙醇（isopropyl alcohol）特性的敘述中，何者正確？","opts":["乙醇僅可溶解脂肪而不會使蛋白質變性","異丙醇僅可使蛋白質變性而不會溶解脂肪","血液等有機物可明顯下降乙醇的作用","異丙醇最常使用的濃度為35-45％（v/v）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":49,"q":"下列何者不具有β-lactam雙環的基本結構？","opts":["imipenem","aztreonam","oxacillin","cefazolin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":50,"q":"併用三種磺胺劑的最主要原因在於：","opts":["延長投藥的間隔期間","減少尿結石的產生","縮短治療期間","增高血中濃度並增強抗菌效力"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"下列何者投藥後不需經過分解程序，藥物本身即具有活性？","opts":["chloramphenicol succinate","erythromycin estolate","clindamycin hydrochloride","sulfasalazine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"下列有關磺胺劑併用ormetoprim的敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["延長藥物在體內的作用時間","可達到殺菌（bacteriocidal）效果","增廣抗菌範圍","增強抗菌作用"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"養殖魚類以trichlorfon藥浴，其停藥期為：","opts":["5日","7日","14日","21日"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"下列何者對魚類具鎮定作用？","opts":["hydrogen peroxide","magnesium sulfate","potassium permanganate","tricaine methanesulfonate"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"臨床上amoxicillin常與下列何者合併投藥？","opts":["ascorbic acid","clavulanic acid","folic acid","oxalic acid"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"下列何者最適合用於治療立克次體（Rickettsiae）或披衣菌（chlamydiae）之感染症？","opts":["neomycin","minocycline","tylosin","cephalexin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"下列何者為polymyxin B、bacitracin和neomycin可局部使用或經口投藥，但不能注射投藥的主要原因？","opts":["肝毒性太強","腎毒性太強","耳毒性太強","神經毒性太強"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"下列那一種消毒劑在有機物質（血液、黏液）存在時，仍然具有較強之消毒作用？","opts":["benzalkonium chloride","70% alcohol","iodophors","50% isopropyl alcohol"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"Aminoglycosides之殺菌機制為：","opts":["抑制核醣體30S合成蛋白質","抑制核醣體50S合成蛋白質","抑制DNA合成","抑制細胞壁合成"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"下列何者對G（-）具有良好的抗菌能力，並且於注射給藥後，具有類似penicillin G之分布？","opts":["minocycline","aztreonam","azithromycin","tylosin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"下列何者會增加sulfonamides產生尿結石症？","opts":["增加尿液的酸性","併用三種同類sulfonamides藥","使用sulfonamides鈉鹽之製劑","增高尿的pH值"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"下列何者經口投藥易與金屬離子形成螯合物，影響腸道吸收？","opts":["chlortetracycline","streptomycin","spectinomycin","spiramycin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"抗生素tilmicosin是屬於：","opts":["aminoglycosides","cephalosporins","macrolides","polypeptides"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"Fluoroquinolone類抗菌劑的主要抗菌機制為抑制下列何者？","opts":["DNA","RNA","蛋白質","細胞壁"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"下列何者常用於治療家禽的黴漿菌感染症？","opts":["streptomycin","aztreonam","tylosin","ampicillin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"下列抗黴菌藥中，藥物本身不具殺菌活性，須進入黴菌細胞被代謝後始具活性的藥物是：","opts":["ketoconazole","griseofulvin","flucytosine","amphotericin B"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"Griseofulvin對下列何種黴菌無效？","opts":["念珠球菌（Candida spp.）","表皮癬菌（Epidermophyton spp.）","毛癬菌（Trichophyton spp.）","小芽孢癬菌（Microsporum spp.）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"下列何者可殺滅犬心絲蟲之成蟲與第5期幼蟲？","opts":["milbemycin","melarsomine","selamectin","moxidectin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"作用機制屬於nicotinic agonist的抗寄生蟲藥是：","opts":["milbemycin","moxidectin","piperazine","pyrantel"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"不屬於ionophores的抗球蟲藥是何者？","opts":["lasaloid","monensin","robendine","semduramicin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"下列何者可用於驅除牛肺蟲？","opts":["amprolium","bunamidine","robenidine","levamisole"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"下列何者適用於治療滴蟲症？","opts":["cyproheptadine","metronidazole","propranolol","quinidine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列何者非以阻止神經肌肉的去極化來麻痺蟲體？","opts":["fenbendazole","levamisole","pyrantel","morantel"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"下列何藥物可抑制chitin的生合成？","opts":["diflubenzuron","dithiazanine iodide","bithionol","diamphenethide"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"下列何者歸類為腎毒性黴菌毒素？","opts":["ochratoxin","phallotoxin","zearalenone","aflatoxin B1"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"Acetylcysteine常用於治療貓的何種藥物中毒？","opts":["neostigmine","acetaminophen","morphine","corticosteroids"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"於銅和鉛中毒時，可用下列何者與其螯合？","opts":["tetracycline","pralidoxime","acetylcysteine","penicillamine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"下列那一種動物對α-naphthyl thiourea最不敏感？","opts":["反芻獸","馬","貓","禽類"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"下列何者為注射投予isoproterenol之主要臨床用途？","opts":["治療心跳過快","治療急性支氣管收縮","控制心室性心律不整","治療鼻黏膜充血"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"下列何者為臨床上經口投予prazosin後主要之不良反應？","opts":["血糖過高","低血壓","嗜睡昏迷","肌肉鬆弛無力"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}],"answer":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=S&code=106100&c=314&s=22&q=1"}